be secure in the future?

00:11:39.900 --> 00:11:43.230
And five, are we
working together

00:11:43.230 --> 00:11:47.400
to address the most
important challenges facing

00:11:47.400 --> 00:11:49.260
our world today?

00:11:49.260 --> 00:11:53.830
We help organizations address
these important questions.

00:11:53.830 --> 00:11:54.420
Let's Start.

00:11:54.420 --> 00:11:56.070
With the first question.

00:11:56.070 --> 00:12:00.600
